## Production Deployment Notes

When deployed to Vercel, the Analytics will automatically:
- Track page views and user interactions
- Send data to Vercel's analytics dashboard
- Work seamlessly with Next.js App Router navigation
- Respect the conditional loading (only on Vercel platform)

To verify Analytics is working in production:
1. Deploy to Vercel
2. Visit your site
3. Check browser Network tab for requests to `/_vercel/insights`
4. View analytics data in Vercel dashboard

## Conclusion

Vercel Web Analytics has been properly configured for this project according to the latest official documentation. The implementation follows Next.js App Router best practices and includes smart conditional loading for optimal developer experience.
